  } catch (err) {
    try {
      await client.query("ROLLBACK");
    } catch (rollbackErr) {
      // connection is dead, rollback fails—log but don't mask the original error
    }
    throw err;
  } finally {
    client.release();
  }
}
```

This preserves the original error so the caller knows what actually went wrong.

